  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-specimen/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Banco de la República — Cinco Mil Pesos Oro (Specimen)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/colombia/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Colombia</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Bogotá, Colombia &middot; Especímenes de Cinco Mil Pesos Oro</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">El Banco de la República</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Cinco Mil Pesos Oro, 1986&ndash;1993 &mdash; Rafael Núñez y Miguel Antonio Caro</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 24px;\">\n          <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.7; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Estos tres especímenes, fechados entre 1986 y 1993, comparten el mismo diseño: el retrato de Rafael Núñez en el anverso, junto a una vi&ntilde;eta de la Ermita del Cerrito, y la estatua sedente de Miguel Antonio Caro, rodeada del listado de los estados de los Estados Unidos de Colombia, en el reverso.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n\n          <sc-for list=\"\" as=\"note\" hint-placeholder-count=\"3\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin-bottom:40px;\">\n              <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center;\"></span>\n\n              <button\n                aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete\"\n                style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-1993-specimen-640.webp 640w, uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-1986-specimen.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-1986-specimen.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    width=\"564\"\n                    loading=\"lazy\"\n                    decoding=\"async\"\n                    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n                <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n                  <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n                  Ampliar\n                </span>\n              </button>\n              <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) &mdash; Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n\n              <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; margin-top:8px;\">\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Prefijo de Serie</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Anverso</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reverso</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Condición</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n                  <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia</span>\n                  <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick P-439 (subtipo por fecha)</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </sc-for>\n\n        </div>\n\n        \n          <div\n            role=\"dialog\"\n            aria-modal=\"true\"\n            aria-label=\"Billete ampliado\"\n            style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"\n          >\n            <button\n              data-zoom-close\n              aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n              style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n            >&times;</button>\n\n            <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n              <button\n                disabled=\"true\"\n                aria-label=\"Alejar\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&minus;</button>\n              <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n              <button\n                disabled=\"false\"\n                aria-label=\"Acercar\"\n                style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&#43;</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div\n              style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n            >\n              <picture>\n                <source srcset=\"uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-1986-specimen.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                <img\n                  src=\"uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-5000-pesos-oro-1986-specimen.jpg\"\n                  alt=\"Billete ampliado\"\n                  draggable=\"false\"\n                  style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                />\n              </picture>\n            </div>\n\n            <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n          </div>\n        \n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Dos Presidentes en un Billete</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">El anverso retrata a Rafael Núñez, poeta y estadista, artífice de la Constitución de 1886 y de la Regeneración política colombiana, con una vi&ntilde;eta de la Ermita del Cerrito de Cartagena. El reverso presenta la estatua sedente de Miguel Antonio Caro, escritor, filólogo y vicepresidente que redactó la Constitución de 1886, rodeada del listado de los antiguos Estados Unidos de Colombia (1863&ndash;1886): Antioquia, Bolívar, Boyacá, Cauca, Cundinamarca, Magdalena, Panamá, Santander y Tolima.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Los tres especímenes llevan la sobreimpresión roja &ldquo;SPECIMEN&rdquo; o &ldquo;MUESTRA SIN VALOR&rdquo;, numeración en ceros y perforaciones de cancelación, y se distinguen entre sí únicamente por la fecha y el prefijo de serie.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Fuentes</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Pick, Albert. <em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money.</em></li>\n              <li>Hernández, Pedro Pablo. <em>Monedas y Billetes de Colombia.</em></li>\n              <li>Restrepo, Jorge Emilio. <em>Coins of Colombia.</em></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions — <a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com</a></li>\n              <li>Numista — <a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com</a></li>\n              <li>Banco de la República — <a href=\"https://www.banrep.gov.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">banrep.gov.co</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
